{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56115","headline":"步虚词 八 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"稽首礼太上，烧香归虚无。\n流明随手回，法轮亦三周。\n玄顺四大兴，灵庆及王侯。\n七祖生天堂，煌煌耀景敷。\n啸歌冠太漠，天乐适我娱。\n齐馨无上德，下仙不与俦。\n妙想明玄觉，诜诜乘虚游。\n（同前卷廿二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}